name: DFD evidence paths open saved findings and return to the diagram
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_findings.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: findings filter file:unrelated.tf
require-live-snap: 20 1 of 1 | prior-filter
submit: map
require-live-snap: 20 SYSTEM SUMMARY | map-summary
expect: Esc then z
nav-mode:
keys: Tab z
require-live-snap: 20 findings at paths | topology
expect: findings at paths
resize: 160x48
live-snap: topology-160x48
expect: f findings
resize: 96x89
live-snap: topology-96x89
expect: f findings
resize: 80x24
live-snap: topology-80x24
expect: f findings
resize: 60x20
live-snap: topology-60x20
expect: f findings
resize: 40x12
live-snap: topology-40x12
expect: f findings
resize: 120x36
keys: j f
require-live-snap: 20 2 of 2 | evidence-findings
expect: Path matches span saved revisions
resize: 160x48
live-snap: findings-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: findings-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: findings-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: findings-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: findings-40x12
expect: saved revisions
expect: q diagram
ask: Can the operator read the matched queue at all six sizes while distinguishing evidence-path matches from source-revision or verdict equivalence?
resize: 120x36
keys: q
require-live-snap: 20 findings at paths | returned-topology
keys: Enter
resize: 40x12
live-snap: focused-context-40x12
expect: f findings
expect: Enter graph
expect: q back
resize: 120x36
keys: f
require-live-snap: 20 1 of 1 | selected-context-findings
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_findings.py @TMP_TARGET @ART selected-row
submit: back
require-live-snap: 20 Enter topology | returned-context
keys: Enter j j f
require-live-snap: 20 2 of 2 | flow-findings
submit: back
require-live-snap: 20 findings at paths | returned-flow
keys: j j f
require-live-snap: 20 2 of 2 | boundary-findings
submit: back
require-live-snap: 20 findings at paths | returned-boundary
keys: j f
require-live-snap: 20 repository file evidence | missing-evidence
expect: findings at paths
ask: Do Back and the empty-evidence state preserve the selected diagram, context focus and original workflow without starting work?
keys: q
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 20 1 of 1 | restored-prior-filter
expect: file:unrelated.tf
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: map
require-live-snap: 20 SYSTEM SUMMARY | restarted-map
expect: Esc then z
nav-mode:
keys: Tab z
require-live-snap: 20 findings at paths | restarted-topology
keys: j f
require-live-snap: 20 2 of 2 | restarted-findings
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_findings.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart reproduce the exact file selection, exclude the similarly named file and retain all four independent observations?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
